  title: "Electric Trams \u2013 1905 "
  info: Singapore introduced its first electric trams in the early 20th century,
    replacing horse-drawn carriages. Operated by the Singapore Tramways Company,
    trams provided an efficient way for people to travel across the city. However,
    the system was short-lived, ceasing operations by 1927 due to rising car and
    bus usage.
